  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5205.05 Appeal of Commissioner’s Decision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5205.05 Appeal of Commissioner’s Decision. A person aggrieved by the commissioner’s decision may file an appeal in the superior court in the same manner as prescribed in RSA 263:75, II and III.\n\nSource. #12614-A, eff 8-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5200.html"
